Subject: [PATCH] lane-302: register lever 11 as an opt-in protected capability
 (vulkan-moe-gather-iq4nl-nounroll-optin)

HQ85 05:0x ruled lever 11 (04f6f9f218, GGML_ARIFI_MOE_NOUNROLL) stays default OFF: the op win
(idg_iq4_nl n2-n5 -15..-23%, cellAA-10082306) did not reach the 4-prompt pooled served wall
(cellAB-10090143 LOSSLESS-TIE). The row protects the switch so an incoming change cannot drop it
silently, the same pattern as 1ee7a6e735. validate --draft PASS, 64 entries, 166 anchors
(cache/moe-gather-x1-lane/cells/pwvalidate-r57.txt).

Origin: lane-302
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED (manifest bookkeeping, no code)
